### Get all product models

GET http://localhost:5000/api/product_models
Content-Type: application/json

### Get product model with id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/product_models/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create product model

POST http://localhost:5000/api/product_models
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Example Model",
  "brand_id": 1,
  "description": "Example model description"
}

### Update product model

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/product_models
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Example Model",
  "brand_id": 1,
  "description": "Updated model description"
}

### Delete product model with id

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/product_models/1
Content-Type: application/json
